>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Finlay</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Shop\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Shop</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">The Oak Depot</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Price\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Price</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">$1,900</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Function\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Function</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Turns refined ores into ingots</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">v1.0.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">January 14th, 2023</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p><big><i>\"A fiery forge used for processing refined materials! Creates nice and smooth bars.\"</i></big>\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\">Description</span></h2>\n<p>The <b>Rusty Forge</b> is the first obtainable tier of forges. It can be found and purchased at <a href=\"/wiki/The_Oak_Depot\" title=\"The Oak Depot\">The Oak Depot</a>. It is used to smelt refined ores/rocks (which can be done through a refinery) into forged ingots/rocks by putting them through its conveyor. \n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearance\">Appearance</span></h2>\n<p>The forge appears to be rusty (as the name may suggest) and bears a slight resemblance to the sawmill from Lumber Tycoon 2, another game of a similar genre.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>The forge bears a faint resemblance to the Sawmill from Lumber Tycoon 2.</li>\n<li>The only ore not to increase in value if put through it is <a href=\"/wiki/Magnetite\" title=\"Magnetite\">Magnetite</a>.</li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260902232059\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.028 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.047 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 68/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 66/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 6/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 28/5000000 bytes\nLua time usage: 0.005/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 1019472/104857600 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   38.600      1 Template:Objects\n100.00%   38.600      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key 1.43.9_prod_oaklands:pcache:idhash:261-0!sseVary=RegularPage!FandomDesktop!LegacyGalleries and timestamp 20260902232059 and revision id 19113. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>","categories":["Structures"],"links":[{"title":"Magnetite","exists":true},{"title":"The Oak Depot","exists":true}],"images":["Rusty_Forge_unboxed.png","RustyForgeBoxed.png"]}
